# Builder working files. They hold the plain-text answers of puzzles you have scheduled but not released yet:
# on a public repository anyone could read them (the published site/puzzles/ files are obfuscated, these are not).
# Remove these lines if your repository is private and you want drafts and your clue memory backed up in git.
drafts/
data/user-clues.json*

# Temp files from interrupted atomic writes (they may hold answers too).
*.tmp
